SUMMARY:Garden disasters
DESCRIPTION:Every garden will eventually face some natural disasters and some human-made disasters. Learn what they are and how to combat\, manage or live in harmony with them. From Japanese beetles to squirrel invasions\, to fungal diseases\, tree issues\, and invasive plants\, we’ll cover the top ones and give you the strategies to face them head on. \nFor more information\, contact Riverdale Horticultural Society – https://riverdalehorticultural.ca/
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/garden-disasters-2/
END:VEVENT
